DAR KAY JHAARI MAIN CHUPAY AKAY WOH DONO BHAI<br />
<br />
HAAY IS UMR MAIN MAASOOMO PAY KAISAY BAIDAAD<br />
DIL MAIN GHUM AANKHO MAIN AANSO THEY LABOO PER FARYAD<br />
<br />
<br />
KEHTAY HAIN JHAARI KAY NAZDEEK THI EK NEHAR RAWAAN<br />
LONDI HAARIS KI JO PANI KAY LIYE AAY WAHAN<br />
SUN KAY RONAY KI SADA HOGAYE DIL MAIN HAIRAAN<br />
BARH KAY DEKHA TU NAZAR AGAY BACHAY DO NEHAAN<br />
<br />
BOLI KYUN ROTAY HO GHUM KIA HAI PISAR KIS KAY HO<br />
CHUP KAY KYUN BETHAY HO TUM NOR-E-NAZAR KIS KAY HO<br />
<br />
<br />
DEKH KAR MEHARBAAN AURAT KO WOH BOLAY RO KAR<br />
HAAY KIS TARHAN KAHAIN KIS KAY HAIN HUM NOOR-E-NAZAR<br />
YEH MOHAMMAD(s.a.w.w.) KAY NAWASAY HAIN TUM MUSLIM(a.s.) K PISAR<br />
LUT GAY HUM KAY YAHAN MAARA GAYA APNA PADAR<br />
<br />
KOOFI DUSHMAN HUAY QISMAT MAIN SIYAAHI AAY<br />
HAAY PARDAIS MAIN KAISI TABAHI AAY<br />
<br />
<br />
LONDI GHAR LAY KAY UNHAY AGAYEE BAA DEDAY NUM<br />
APNI BIBI SAY KAHI BACHO KI RUDAADE ILAM<br />
DEKH KAY BACHO KO BIBI KO HUWA BEHAD GHUM<br />
BOLI AFSOOS KAY MASOOM PAY YEH ZULM-O-SITAM<br />
<br />
KITNE BAY DARD SITAMGAR HAIN YEH KOFAY WALAY<br />
UN PAY KARTAY HAIN SITAM JO HAIN NABI(s.a.w.w.) KAY PAALAY<br />
<br />
<br />
KHANA KHIWAA KAY UNHAY BIBI NAY POSHIDA KYA<br />
RAAT KO HAARIS-E-BAD ZAAT JO GHAR KO AYA<br />
