HAAY QISMAT KAY UNHAY KHUWAAB MAIN YEH AAYA NAZAR<br />
SAAMNAY KHOON MAIN DOOBA HAI KHARA UN KA PADAR<br />
<br />
CHEEKH UTHAY KHUWAB MAIN YEH DEKH KAY DONO BHAI<br />
KAAN MAIN HAARIS-E-MALAOON KAY AAWAZ AY<br />
